  "description": "Ride with the Vibe!\n\nThe 20\" Ozark Trail® Vibe mountain bike hits the sweet spot with its capability, versatility, and affordability! This mountain bike is designed specifically for your young riders' trail-riding needs. The dual mechanical disc brakes gives substantial stopping power during normal trail riding and deep descents. The knobby MTB tires can tackle tougher terrain with ease. Quickly and smoothly transition through the 7 gears with the handlebar-mounted trigger shifters as you tear up the trail. Adjustability is key for a proper fit, so this bike offers great geometry and an adjustable saddle height for growing riders. If you're looking for a capable mountain bike for your child, tween, or teen, the 20\" Ozark Trail® Vibe has you covered!\n\nKEY FEATURES:",
